  "absolute_mass_provenance": "ModificationsDB routes UniMod/custom XML through UnimodXMLDataProvider and UnimodXMLHandler (delta masses); OBODataProvider reads MassMono/MassAvg into declared absolute fields. ResidueModification defaults absolute fields to zero and its existing record loader retains that default. Positive declared masses are independently tested using checked owned copies; this does not claim the native registry imports OBO datasets."
